ok - receipts: a message is accepted, picked up, started, progressed, and given a result from the status lines after it; a removed record gets no more
ok - delivery: each attempt records its result and the input-line verdict it read
ok - draft guard: strict never types or submits on an unproven input line, advisory still rings, and the read-to-Enter race is the pinned residual
ok - live status: input-line reading, queued steering, last delivery, and an open approval prompt are readable outside the pane
ok - watcher: an ordinary poll refreshes the task's live status file
